.TH "gtk4-demo" "1" "" "GTK" "GTK commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gtk4-demo \- Demonstrate GTK widgets
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
\fBgtk4\-demo\fP [OPTIONS...]
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBgtk4\-demo\fP is a collection of examples.
.sp
Its purpose is to demonstrate many GTK widgets in a form that is useful to
application developers.
.sp
The application shows the source code for each example, as well as other used
resources, such as UI description files and image assets.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show help options.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-version\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show program version.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-list\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
List available examples.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-run EXAMPLE\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Run the named example. Use \fB\-\-list\fP to see the available examples.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-autoquit\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Quit after a short timeout. This is intended for use with \fB\-\-run\fP, e.g. when profiling.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
